From: ImmortalWrt <devnull@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] airoha-pon: declare shared PHY helpers

The PMA translation unit calls helpers implemented in the AN7581 source set.
Expose their declarations from the common LF-terminated PHY header so the
Linux 6.18 compiler does not infer incompatible implicit prototypes.

---
--- a/xpon-en757x/xpon_phy_10g/inc/phy.h
+++ b/xpon-en757x/xpon_phy_10g/inc/phy.h
@@ -8,6 +8,9 @@
 #include "phy_debug.h"
 #include "phy_tx.h"
 
+void phy_delay1ms(int ms);
+void XPON_DIG_ref_release(void);
+
 #if defined(TCSUPPORT_MT7570)||defined(LDDLA_SUPPORT_SET_TX_MODE)
 #include <ecnt_hook/ecnt_hook_lddla.h>
 #endif
